    "chunk_text": "Dr. Lakith Peiris, Managing Director of Hemas Hospitals & Laboratory Chain, said, \u201cAt Hemas Hospital Thalawathugoda, we continue to invest in technology that improves our capacity to deliver accurate and timely diagnostic care. This cutting-edge MRI system brings better care to our patients and provides ourhealthcare professionals withaccess to advanced diagnostic tools. We are excited about the value this technology will bring to patient care and are happy to have worked with DIMO Healthcare to implement it in our hospital.\u201d\n\nThe system supports a wide range of advanced imaging applications, including brain and spine examinations, cardiac MRI, vascular imaging, MRCP, prostate and breast imaging, and whole-body examinations. Dedicated metal artifact reduction sequences also support examinations of patients with MR-conditional implants and orthopedic hardware."
