    "chunk_size_bytes": 1589,
    "chunk_text": "HNBGI clinches five at SLIM National Sales Awards 2026\n\nHNBGI award winners with HNBGI senior officials at the SLIM National Sales Awards 2026\n\nHNB General Insurance Limited (HNBGI) secured five accolades at the SLIM National Sales Awards 2026 held recently.\n\nOrganized by the Sri Lanka Institute of Marketing (SLIM), the awards serve as the premier national platform honoring exceptional sales talent, strategy, and performance across industries.\n\nIn the 2026 edition, HNBGI\u2019s high-performing professionals secured honours under the Insurance - General category across frontline, supervisory, and managerial tiers. Isuri Sasindri Suriyaarachchi achieved the Silver Award in the Front Liners (FL) category, while D. A. N. G. Rathnawardana earned a Silver Award in the Sales Supervisor category.\n\nDemonstrating the company\u2019s depth of supervisory and operational talent, Piyumal Manchanayake picked up a Bronze Award for Sales Supervisor, alongside Merit Awards presented to Dushantha Yatiwella (Sales Executive) and Ingalahewage Don Roshan Lasantha (Territory Manager).\n\nThis national recognition reflects a broader corporate ecosystem designed to nurture, empower, and reward sales leadership at every level. HNBGI\u2019s sales strategy is underpinned by a multi-channel distribution model - spanning Agency, Corporate, Takaful, Broker, Direct that has consistently earned industry accolades. Supported by 57 branches and 4 business development offices nationwide and HNBGI\u2019s sales teams are backed by continuous technology integration, standardized KPIs, and rapid feedback mechanisms."
