    "chunk_text": "Senti helps organizations better understand fleet activity and make more informed operational decisions by connecting vehicle data with intelligent insights. Its applications are relevant to industries where vehicle utilization, delivery reliability, and operational visibility are critical to daily operations, such as manufacturing, retail, healthcare, agriculture, and public transport.\n\nWe extend our sincere appreciation to the entire team whose collective vision, expertise, and dedication have been instrumental in bringing Senti to this milestone. This achievement reflects the power of collaboration and our shared commitment to innovation and excellence. As we look ahead, we remain focused on building solutions that create meaningful business impact, strengthen our global competitiveness, and demonstrate the potential of Sri Lankan innovation on the international stage. This recognition is an important milestone in a journey to be the future leader in the IoT and AI marketing in Sri Lanka and the region.\u201d\n\nSenti is recognized in the Transport in Industrial category by the NBQSA Bronze Award. In addition, Softlogic Information Technologies is recognized by the ASOCIO Digital & AI Award in the AI in Manufacturing/Supply Chain category, which reflects the company\u2019s wider efforts to apply AI to supply chain and industrial challenges.\n\nUnderstanding what operational data can reveal and how those insights might help everyday decisions is crucial for organizations considering fleet technology. Softlogic Information Technologies seeks to make AI and IoT more useful for businesses looking for better operational visibility with solutions like Senti."
