    "date_str": "2026-11-03",
    "description": "\u2018Please allow us to tell our stories\u2019:  Theepachelvan on the struggles of Tamil writers",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Please-allow-us-to-tell-our-stories-Theepachelvan-on-the-struggles-of-Tamil-writers/231-354042",
    "lang": "en",
