    "chunk_text": "Landslide warnings issued for several areas\n\nColombo, Nov. 3 (Daily Mirror) - The National Building Research Institute (NBRI) has issued landslide early warnings for several areas across the country amid prevailing adverse weather conditions.\n\nThe warnings will remain in effect from 4.00 p.m. today (November 3) until 4.00 p.m. tomorrow (November 4), according to the NBRI.\n\nUnder Level 2 \u2013 Amber (Warning), the following areas have been identified as being at risk:\n\nMeanwhile, Level 1 \u2013 Yellow (Watch) warnings have been issued for several other areas.\n\nKegalle District: Aranayaka, Mawanella, Ruwanwella, Rambukkana, Yatiyanthota, Bulathkohupitiya and Kegalle\n\nNuwara Eliya District: Kotmale West, Ambagamuwa, Hanguranketha, Walapane and Norwood"
