    "description": "New UN Women report calls for stronger action to advance women\u2019s political leadership in SL",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/New-UN-Women-report-calls-for-stronger-action-to-advance-women-s-political-leadership-in-SL/56-799584",
