    "chunk_text": "EPF ups stake in ACL Cables to over 10%\n\nThe Employees\u2019 Provident Fund (EPF) has increased its stake in ACL Cables PLC to over 10%.\n\nACL in a disclosure Monday said EPF shareholding in the company increased to 71.9 million shares, representing 10% of the issued share capital, as at 30 September 2026, through a series of transactions.\n\nAs at June 2026, the EPF held 68.9 million shares, equivalent to 9.6% stake. It remains the third largest shareholder overall whilst being the biggest institutional shareholder.\n\nACL Cables share price gained by 30 cents on Monday to close at Rs. 89."
