    "description": "South Asia\u2019s demographic shift is an opportunity\u2014but only if the region acts now",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/South-Asia-s-demographic-shift-is-an-opportunitybut-only-if-the-region-acts-now/4-799607",
