    "chunk_text": "Fire erupts at auto spare parts shop in Katugastota\n\nColombo, Nov. 4 (Daily Mirror) - A fire broke out at an auto spare parts shop in the Kudugala area of Katugastota at around 5:30 a.m. today (November 4).\n\nAccording to the police, traffic along the Kandy\u2013Jaffna A9 main road near Kudugala was temporarily disrupted for nearly an hour due to the incident.\n\nFirefighting teams from the Kandy and Matale Fire Units were deployed to the scene and successfully brought the blaze under control.\n\nThe cause of the fire has not yet been determined, while Katugastota Police have launched further investigations into the incident."
