    "md5": "0ee87d6f3263efc941af857d8adb3281",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1790,
    "chunk_text": "Dialog Brings Apple\u2019s iPhone 18 Pro Series and iPhone Duo to Customers in Sri Lanka\n\nFrom left to right: Shiromy Ali, Head of Corporate Planning, Strategy and Growth, Group Corporate Planning and Strategy, Group Business Operations, Dialog Axiata PLC; Vinoj Gunasekaran, Pre-order Customer; Lasantha Theverapperuma, Group Chief Marketing Officer, Dialog Axiata PLC; Deshan Wijeweera, Head of Device Business, Growth and Operations, Group Business Operations, Dialog Axiata PLC.\n\nDialog Axiata PLC, Sri Lanka\u2019s #1 connectivity provider, announced the arrival of the iPhone 18 Pro, iPhone 18 Pro Max and iPhone Duo in Sri Lanka through its partnership with Apple. The devices support 5G and eSIM capabilities, enabling customers to experience the latest iPhone lineup on Dialog 5G Ultra, Sri Lanka\u2019s largest and fastest-growing 5G network, powered by over 1,000 5G sites across all 25 districts. The launch of the iPhone Duo in Sri Lanka took place in parallel with its global launch, giving Dialog customers access to Apple\u2019s latest iPhone innovation earlier than the typical 5\u20136-week interval between global and Sri Lankan launches.\n\nThe iPhone 18 Pro features a 6.3-inch display, while the iPhone 18 Pro Max features a 6.9-inch display. Both devices are available with storage options ranging from 256GB to 2TB. The iPhone Duo features Apple\u2019s largest iPhone display and is available with storage options ranging from 256GB to 2TB.\n\nThe iPhone Duo is Apple\u2019s first foldable, book-shaped iPhone and features Apple\u2019s largest iPhone display. It includes a matte inner display, side Touch ID, Apple Pencil support and multi-app multitasking, and is available with storage options ranging from 256GB to 2TB. The devices are available in Deep Black, Silver, Glacier and Burgundy."
