    "chunk_text": "NEO\u2019s Hard Talk event on Friday\n\nNEO Technologies will host its premier Hard Talk event aboard the romantic 8Degrees @ Cinnamon Lakeside, on Friday, November 6, from 6:00 p.m..\n\nNEO will bring together top diplomats, business leaders and close allies for an evening to remember.\n\nRenowned photographer, writer and educator Ian Lockwood will take guests on a magical journey to Serendipitys\u2019 Sky Islands, Sri Lanka\u2019s unique rainforest landscapes.\n\nFollowing is the Sweet Spot of Management talk by NEO founder Major Tissa Aluwihare, encompassing his journey of 40 years as a visionary entrepreneur.\n\nThe actual Hard Talk Forum will encourage a candid exchange of perspectives on Sri Lanka\u2019s commercial security industry.\n\nFor all to enjoy, there will be curated culinary delights, lovely cocktails and drinks accompanied by cool music by Sheam Dean & Band."
