    "chunk_text": "LOLC Finance retains Most Valuable NBFI Brand position\n\nLOLC Finance Chief Executive Officer Krishan Thilakaratne and LOLC Finance Head of Marketing Communications Prasad Perera (left) receive Brand Finance \u2013 100 Most Valuable Brands 2026 Award from Brand Finance Lanka Chairman Ruchi Gunewardene and Echelon Media Executive Director Antoinette Ludowyk (right)\n\nLOLC Finance has been recognised as Sri Lanka\u2019s Most Valuable NBFI Brand for the fifth consecutive year, solidifying its market leadership in brand value within the financial services sector.\n\nIn the Brand Finance Sri Lanka 100 rankings for 2026, LOLC Finance secured the 15th place overall, recording a brand value of Rs.13,788 million alongside an AA+ brand rating, emphasising the sustained strength of the brand within Sri Lanka\u2019s financial landscape.\n\nBrand Finance evaluates brands based on internationally recognised standards, combining measures of brand value with a comprehensive assessment of brand strength through metrics such as marketing investment, stakeholder equity and business performance."
