    "language": "en",
    "md5": "a1b544857dc10386cb09c71e806cdaa9",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2005,
    "chunk_text": "It took almost two decades from the 1977 debacle for the SLFP to win under Chandrika Bandaranaike Kumaratunga.\n\nNo President since JR Jayewardene had the chances and options of CBK as president but she consistently ignored them in favour of unrealistic, irrational, irresponsible experimentation.\n\nDespite the fact that an LTTE suicide bomber tried to kill her at an election rally in 1999, she pursued a Norwegian-facilitated peace effort. When \u20189/11\u2019 provided the perfect opening\u00a0 for widespread global support to win the war and follow-up with devolution, she continued dogmatically with the one-sided Norwegian effort.\n\nThe rise of the extremist ultranationalist Sinhala new right ancestor of the BBS, led at the time by Champika Ranawake, was an outcome\u2014as was the dramatic ascendancy of the JVP.\n\nThe JVP was crushed and decapitated in November 1989, the very year after it assassinated Vijaya Kumaratunga by shooting him in the face on his doorstep. At the time the JVP didn\u2019t disclaim the\u00a0 brutal killing despite the huge public opinion backlash. Instead, on the day of Vijaya\u2019s funeral, the JVP\u2019s front organisation-cum-military wing the DJV (precursor of today\u2019s NPP or JJB) distributed an openly justificatory leaflet entitled \u2018Vijaya Yavvey Aiy?\u2019 which in translation meant \u2018Why Was Vijaya Despatched?\u2019 It called him a CIA agent, among other things.\n\nThe JVP\u2019s catapulting to the Presidency and huge preponderance in Parliament in 2024 was mightily assisted by the laundering through a Presidential Commission appointed by President Chandrika Bandaranaike Kumaratunga of the stain of the delegitimising sin of Vijaya Kumaratunga\u2019s cruel murder. She had viciously and irrationally accused President Premadasa (at the time, Prime Minister) and not Wijeweera\u2019s JVP of murdering her husband and father of her two children. This despite the arrest and long, detailed confession by the gunman tasked and trained by the JVP for this and a series of other assassinations."
