    "chunk_text": "The two bills have effectively synthesised the institutional paranoia of the old guard with the administrative discipline of the new left.\n\nThe tragedy of this NPP \"Renaissance\" is that it validates George Orwell\u2019s most basic insight from Animal Farm.\n\nLike Dr. Colvin R. de Silva\u2019s \"Dickie\" Jayewardene before him, AKD is running faster than the winds of social and economic crises buffering on his presidency.\n\nBut in his rush to outrun the storm, he is outrunning his own promises, leaving democratic safeguards far behind in the dust.\n\nThe parallel legal structures being built today are designed to bypass the ordinary safeguards of criminal law, allowing the Ministry of Public Security to bypass magistrates and detain citizens for up to a year on mere \"reasonable suspicion\".\n\nThe next time you feel the urge to exercise your constitutional right to protest, or perhaps just write a critique of the regime, please remember you are now in a new Ethically Exemplary Orwellian Country. The State is always right. Saints are marching on."
