    "chunk_size_bytes": 1756,
    "chunk_text": "Sriyan de Silva Wijeyeratne joins Gestetner Board\n\nGestetner of Ceylon PLC has appointed Sriyan de Silva Wijeyeratne to its Board as an Independent Non-Executive Director.\n\nWijeyeratne who has held several leading Corporate and other roles across his multifaceted career spanning over 30 years. He played transformative roles during his tenure as the MD/ CEO of Teejay Lanka PLC, which surged to become one of the S&P Top 20 Companies during his time and was recognised as a Winner of Forbes \u201cAsia\u2019s 200 Best under a Billion Dollar Company\u201d, and he delivered similar transformation while being MD of the Hemas Consumer Business.\n\nHe served as Country Manager of Microsoft for nine years, establishing their footprint while building many initiatives of national significance and winning many awards along with his team. He was later entrusted with running the Microsoft business for Bangladesh and Nepal as well. Wijeyeratne was also a previous Chairman/CEO of the Employees Trust Fund Board, a Marketing Director in Telecommunication, a Group CEO in Consumer Electronics and managing FMCG Brands within Nestles. His current Independent Director roles include that of Allianz Insurance, where he also chairs the Audit Committee, and he is a past Chairman of Axion Solutions Ltd.\n\nHe is currently engaged with Startup operations, Conservation initiatives, and in providing Consulting support to limited businesses who are hungry for growth and transformation. His skill in growing people and delivering demonstrated breakthrough results repeatedly through existing teams, stem from the ability to combine best practices from different disciplines and industries with a bias for practical action, and by challenging norms which inhibit growth potential."
  },
