    "num": "dailyftlk-e18bce99",
    "date_str": "2026-11-05",
    "description": "CHOGM 2026 opens with drive to unlock prosperity for Commonwealth\u2019s 2.7 billion people",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/CHOGM-2026-opens-with-drive-to-unlock-prosperity-for-Commonwealth-s-2-7-billion-people/56-799675",
