    "chunk_size_bytes": 1856,
    "chunk_text": "Janashakthi Finance wins Silver at SLITAD People Development Awards\n\nJanashakthi Finance PLC has received a Silver Award at the Sri Lanka Institute of Training and Development (SLITAD) People Development Awards 2025/26.\n\nGuided by JXG\u2019s core values of Integrity, Collaboration, Respect, Performance Driven, and Innovation, Janashakthi Finance places people development at the heart of its organisational culture. Its approach connects individual growth with business priorities through continuous learning, capability building, and professional development. The Company seeks to help employees develop their strengths, respond to evolving customer expectations, and contribute to stronger organisational performance.\n\nDiscussing the recognition, Sithambaram Sri Ganendran, Chief Executive Officer of Janashakthi Finance PLC said, \u201cOur people are central to Janashakthi Finance\u2019s progress. This accolade reflects the commitment of our employees and the work undertaken to strengthen their capabilities. Our priority is to translate learning into better customer service, stronger accountability, and improved business performance, while creating opportunities for our people to grow with the company.\u201d\n\nSachinthani Meeriyagalla, Head of Human Resources at Janashakthi Finance PLC, added, \u201cEvery employee has the potential to learn, grow, and contribute in different ways. Our focus is on helping everyone on our team identify their strengths and needs, while encouraging them to apply what they learn in their day-to-day roles. We want our people to feel valued, take ownership of their development, and lead fulfilling careers with Janashakthi Finance.\u201d\n\nBuilding on this recognition, Janashakthi Finance said it will continue to strengthen its learning culture and support employee development in line with the Company\u2019s business priorities."
