    "chunk_text": "MAXXIS recognizes top dealers at Awards Night\n\nThe MAXXIS Annual Awards Night, themed \u2018MAXXIS Champions of Champions 2025\u2019, was held recently at the Shangri-La Hotel, Colombo.\n\nAround 200 MAXXIS dealers and their families attended the event, where 60 dealers were evaluated for award presentations. The Winner of the Year 2025 was Wijaya Motors & Tyre House (Pvt) Ltd., Colombo 14; the trophy was presented to Managing Director\u00a0 Sajith Sankalana by Kenny, Section Manager, MAXXIS International Taiwan jointly with Lesley Fonseka and\u00a0 Sunil Fonseka of Tyre House Group."
