    "chunk_text": "Assessments are built into the learning journey rather than sitting outside it. Supported question types are evaluated automatically, and configurable feedback and explanations help learners understand their results. Learners can access every certificate they have earned, and certificate verification details can be shared so that their achievements can be confirmed.\n\nDashboards surface measures including course enrolment and completion, time to completion, engagement trends, and learner drop-off. Individual learner views show progress, completion status, scores, certificates, and learning history.\n\nThe platform also introduces a skills-based foundation, connecting skills with courses, learning pathways, and learner profiles to support more relevant development opportunities.\n\nMiHCM has already moved its own workforce onto the new platform. \u201cThe best proof of a learning platform is using it to develop your own team and that experience has shaped what we are now bringing to our customers,\u201d stressed Purasinghe."
