    "md5": "274bb3c856a656767e8963653081b646",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1629,
    "chunk_text": "SLT-MOBITEL Enterprise unveils \u2018SASE 361\u2019 to advance secure digital transformation\n\nHeralding an important milestone in SLT-MOBITEL\u2019s transformation from a traditional telecommunications provider to a leading technology and digital services provider, SLT-MOBITEL Enterprise recently unveiled SASE 361, a next-generation Secure Access Service Edge (SASE) service powered by Versa Networks.\n\nThe launch of SASE 361, held at Cinnamon Life, Colombo, convened enterprise leaders, technology experts, customers, and partners keen to explore the future of cloud-native networking and cybersecurity.\n\nAttendees witnessed how SASE 361 is set to reinvent the future of enterprise IT, enabling organizations to embrace a more secure, agile, and digitally connected future.\n\nThe service endorses SLT-MOBITEL\u2019s role as Sri Lanka\u2019s trusted digital enabler, pairing global expertise with local delivery to help enterprises advance their digital transformation securely, efficiently, and with confidence.\n\nThe unveiling of SASE 361 establishes a strategic leap in supporting businesses to thrive in a rapidly evolving digital environment, aligning with the country\u2019s vision for innovation, competitiveness, and sustainable growth.\n\nSecure Access Service Edge (SASE) is a cloud-native framework unifying networking and security into a single service, helping organizations simplify infrastructure, protect data, and provide secure access for users, devices, and locations. Instead of relying on traditional, centralized data center security, SASE delivers connectivity and protection at the network edge, closer to where work happens."
