    "chunk_text": "Secure Access Service Edge (SASE) is a cloud-native framework unifying networking and security into a single service, helping organizations simplify infrastructure, protect data, and provide secure access for users, devices, and locations. Instead of relying on traditional, centralized data center security, SASE delivers connectivity and protection at the network edge, closer to where work happens.\n\nThe service offers secure connectivity, cloud-delivered security, and simplified network management, redefining enterprise networking and security in Sri Lanka. With real-time visibility, advanced threat protection, and streamlined operations, SASE 361 enables businesses to protect critical data, enhance performance for distributed workforces, and reduce complexity, consolidating multiple functions into one platform.\n\nThe strategic partnership with Versa Networks, a global leader in SASE, and Connex Information Technologies, the value-added local distribution partner, further strengthens SLT-MOBITEL Enterprise\u2019s ability to deliver world-class solutions backed through trusted local expertise. Together, these collaborations help Sri Lankan enterprises gain access to proven global technology tailored to local needs."
