    "description": "UN reports no accountability in 90% of journalist deaths",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/UN-reports-no-accountability-in-90-of-journalist-deaths/172-354221",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
