    "chunk_text": "Cristiano Ronaldo announces retirement from Portuguese national team\n\nNOV.05 - Cristiano Ronaldo \u200bannounced his intention \u200cto retire from the \u200bPortuguese national \u200bteam on Thursday in \u2060a \u200bsocial media post.\n\nThe \u200b41-year-old said that he would 'hand back \u200bthe \u200bnumber 7 shirt' after \u200cthe \u2060November international break.\n\nRonaldo has made 234 \u200bappearances \u200bfor \u2060Portugal and scored \u200b146 goals.\n\nHe \u200bholds \u2060the all-time record for \u2060international \u200bappearances and \u200bfor international goals. -\u00a0Reuters"
