    "date_str": "2026-11-06",
    "description": "Trump\u2019s midterm rout: A lesson in the limits of a superpower",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Trumps-midterm-rout-A-lesson-in-the-limits-of-a-superpower/172-354291",
    "lang": "en",
