    "description": "Trump signs order preventing future presidents from changing Oval Office",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Trump-signs-order-preventing-future-presidents-from-changing-Oval-Office/108-354296",
    "lang": "en",
