    "md5": "a6cc4f78886a4f7e837d4a52b897a0fa",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1796,
    "chunk_text": "Importantly, the expansion demonstrates how locally developed intellectual property can be introduced to overseas markets without the need to rebuild technology platforms for each country.\n\nIt also provides a potential foundation for evaluating further international market opportunities through suitably qualified local partners.\n\nOver the past thirteen years, we have gained valuable experience in understanding the customer engagement challenges faced by established industries. We have translated that experience into proprietary, white-label technology solutions supported by practical marketing intelligence.\u201d\n\n\u201cOur entry into Nepal is not simply about taking a loyalty programme overseas. It is about introducing Sri Lankan-developed technology, specialised industry knowledge and innovative customer engagement solutions to international markets. We believe Sri Lanka has the expertise and intellectual capacity to create technology products that can be commercially deployed beyond our shores under our own brands. Our objective is to demonstrate that potential through sustainable international business development.\u201d\n\nCH17\u2019s international expansion reflects a broader ambition to position Sri Lankan-developed SaaS solutions within the global marketplace for customer engagement and business technology.\n\nWith its proprietary technology platform, experience across multiple industries and focus on scalable white-label solutions, the company aims to establish a sustainable international presence while retaining its technology development and intellectual property base in Sri Lanka.\n\nFor Sri Lanka, it offers another example of how homegrown technology, industry expertise and innovative thinking can create opportunities for international recognition and technology exports."
  },
