    "chunk_text": "\u2018Kaiwaru Muthu\u2019 taken into CID custody following deportation\n\nColombo, Nov 06 (Daily Mirror) - Manoj Muthukumara, alias \u2018Kaiwaru Muthu\u2019, who was arrested in Sharjah, has been taken into custody by the Criminal Investigation Department (CID) following his deportation to Sri Lanka.\n\nCID officers took him into custody at Bandaranaike International Airport in Katunayake upon his arrival in the country.\n\nHe is expected to be handed over to the Western Province South Crimes Division for further investigations."
