    "md5": "383f238bfe8d5498b96952a20e7e2cce",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1801,
    "chunk_text": "Trump threatens more destruction in Iran: \u2019You\u2019ll know soon enough\u2019\n\nGulf News - President Donald Trump said late on Thursday he will soon decide whether to widen the war on Iran, warning the US might have to \u201cdestroy the rest of the country,\u201d Axios reported.\n\nThe remarks came as Democrats\u2019 midterm wins raise questions about how much room he has before the new Congress arrives.\n\nSpeaking in the Oval Office after meeting his national security team, Trump said the administration would make a decision on whether to \u201cgo further\u201d and ensure Iran\u2019s nuclear program can never be revived.\n\nHe added that he would rather not destroy the rest of the country, but \u201cmaybe I\u2019ll have to,\u201d and that people would \u201cknow soon enough.\u201d\n\nHe claimed Iran could take 25 to 30 years to rebuild, and acknowledged that 18 US service members have died in the conflict.\n\nTwo US officials told Axios the meeting was the first on Iran since the midterms. Trump is weighing further strikes, continued economic pressure or a deal.\n\nIran International reported that Democrats\u2019 victory could strengthen oversight, but some analysts say it may encourage Trump to intensify operations before the new Congress takes office in January.\n\nA guest on Iranian state TV speculated that Trump could attack in the roughly two months before then. Others cautioned that a change in Congress alone will not stop the war.\n\nTrump has sent conflicting messages. He told the Financial Times the US had no immediate plans for another major attack, saying \u201cwe\u2019re locked and loaded if we need to go.\u201d\n\nHe told Politico his decision to launch the war was correct, and told The Wall Street Journal it was \u201ca piece\u201d of the election result. He also told Fox News, \u201cI think it\u2019s a gasoline price,\u201d not a war."
