    "chunk_text": "SLIM National Sales Awards 2026 LOLC Insurance celebrates 8 winners\n\nFront row (from left): Dilshani Shashikala (Merit Award \u2013 Sales Supervisor Category, Life Insurance), Khemanthi Peiris (Bronze Award \u2013 Other Sales Support Manager and Above Category \u2013 Life Insurance) and Suresh Madushanka (Bronze Award \u2013 Sales Executive Category, Life Insurance) Back row (from left): Kaushalya Abeygunarathna (Silver Award \u2013 Territory Manager Category, General Insurance), Palika Dilrukshi (Merit Award \u2013 Front Liner Category, Life Insurance), Hasara Sankalpa (Bronze Award \u2013 Territory Manager Category, Life Insurance), Manmadhanayaki Eliyathamby (Merit Award \u2013 Sales Supervisor Category, Life Insurance) and Yashodha Sandamali (Gold Award \u2013 Sales Executive Category, Life Insurance)\n\nEight sales professionals from LOLC Insurance were recognised at SLIM National Sales Awards 2026, securing accolades across multiple categories in recognition of their performance and professional excellence.\n\nAt the 2026 Awards, Yashodha Sandamali secured a Gold award in the Sales Executive Category \u2013 Life Insurance, while Suresh Madushanka received a Bronze award in the same category.\n\nKaushalya Abeygunarathna won a Silver award in the Territory Manager Category \u2013 General Insurance, while Hasara Sankalpa received a Bronze award in the Territory Manager Category \u2013 Life Insurance.\n\nKhemanthi Peiris earned a Bronze award in the Other Sales Support Manager and Above Category, recognising her performance among the nominees from across industries. Meanwhile, Dilshani Shashikala and Manmadhanayaki Eliyathamby received Merit awards in the Sales Supervisor Category \u2013 Life Insurance, while Palika Dilrukshi was recognised with a Merit award in the Front Liner Category \u2013 Life Insurance."
