    "description": "Fitch revises SLT to \u2018AA+(lka)\u2019 on national scale recalibration",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/Fitch-revises-SLT-to-AA-lka-on-national-scale-recalibration/215-354329",
