    "chunk_size_bytes": 1981,
    "chunk_text": "Daraz Sri Lanka introduces \u201811.11 Big Boss Sale\u2019\n\nIts biggest sale of the year with 120+ brands and 11 banking and finance partners joining the campaign, opening at 8 p.m. on 10 November with Brand Rush Hour and \u201cDiscount Pita Discount\u201d savings\n\nDaraz Sri Lanka will launch its 11.11 Big Boss Sale on 10 November at 8 p.m., bringing shoppers deals across electronics, fashion, beauty, groceries and home essentials. Running through 21 November, Daraz\u2019s biggest sale of the year brings together more than 120 brands and 11 banking and finance partners, with voucher savings, card discounts and flexible payment options.\n\nThe campaign opens with Brand Rush Hour, from 8 p.m. on 10 November to 2 a.m. on 11 November. During this six-hour window, shoppers can enjoy a flat 15% discount through Voucher Max, alongside an extra 30% off with KOKO or an extra 25% off with participating bank cards on eligible purchases. Customers can collect the applicable vouchers in the Daraz app and select their preferred eligible payment method at checkout.\n\n\u201c11.11 has become one of the most anticipated moments on Sri Lanka\u2019s shopping calendar, and every year, our focus is on making the experience even more rewarding for customers. With Big Boss, we are bringing together an exciting selection of brands, everyday essentials and multiple ways to save, giving shoppers more reasons to look forward to the campaign. As we celebrate a decade in Sri Lanka, we remain focused on making online shopping more convenient, accessible and valuable for customers, while creating greater opportunities for local businesses to grow,\u201d said Managing Director Rukshan Xavier.\n\nBuilding on its 10-year journey in Sri Lanka, Daraz continues to connect leading brands, local sellers and financial partners with customers across the country. The 11.11 campaign gives participating businesses an opportunity to introduce their products to new customers during Daraz\u2019s largest annual shopping event."
  },
