    "chunk_text": "Building on its 10-year journey in Sri Lanka, Daraz continues to connect leading brands, local sellers and financial partners with customers across the country. The 11.11 campaign gives participating businesses an opportunity to introduce their products to new customers during Daraz\u2019s largest annual shopping event.\n\nShoppers can explore 11.11 offers from ANKER, Marvel Marketing, Celcius Solutions, Swisstek, Hayleys, Diamond Best Foods, Hemas and Unilever, among this year\u2019s Platinum partners. The campaign offers a wide selection across everyday essentials, personal care, electronics and products for the home.\n\nAdding to the savings, 11 banking and finance partners are participating in this year\u2019s 11.11, including Nations Trust Bank, Commercial Bank, Sampath Bank, Bank of Ceylon, Cargills Bank, HNB, Union Bank, LOLC Finance, DFCC Bank, Pan Asia Bank and People\u2019s Bank. Customers can explore additional card offers throughout the campaign, with each partner\u2019s discounts, eligibility requirements and promotional dates available in the Daraz app.\n\nCustomers choosing KOKO can split eligible payments into three or six instalments. Participating banks also offer instalment plans of up to 60 months, depending on the purchase, card and issuing bank. These options give shoppers greater flexibility to spread the cost of eligible purchases, including larger household items.\n\nAhead of opening night, customers can browse the Daraz app, compare products and save their preferred items to their wish lists. Collecting vouchers and reviewing payment eligibility and instalment terms in advance will help shoppers prepare for Brand Rush Hour and choose the offers that suit their purchases.\n\nAfter Brand Rush Hour ends, the 11.11 Big Boss Sale continues through 21 November. Full campaign details and offer terms will be available in the Daraz app."
