    "chunk_text": "This is the greatest menace afflicting our nation today. I know that different social groups have problems unique to them. However, irrespective of social divisions or cultural and linguistic differences, the national menace confronting all of us is the drug menace. We must save our nation from this scourge. We must therefore continue on this path.\n\nA large quantity of drugs was seized during operations last year. The total quantity of drugs seized by us during this year amounts to 438,330 kilograms.\n\nThis menace is destroying our entire younger generation and our future. Those of us who love and care about our country and nation, and who have hopes for the future of our young people, cannot remain silent in the face of this. We have one task before us: to defeat it.\n\nAll these figures demonstrate the scale of this menace. In addition, during this year we have seized 15,282 kg, of narcotic drugs. This includes 6,528 kg, of \u2018Ice\u2019 and 4,000 kg, of heroin. This morning, too, 150 kg of heroin and \u2018Ice\u2019 were seized. We have also seized 2,598 kg of other drugs, 1,841 kg of hashish, 314 kg of cocaine, and nearly 4.5 million drug tablets and capsules.\n\nThe total value of the drugs we have seized is Rs. 218 billion. When cannabis is included, the value rises to Rs. 224 billion. This is the drug market for a single year. When we also take into account the quantities that have not been seized, the enormous scale of the destruction becomes clear."
