    "language": "en",
    "md5": "c2570a32db6e413668c25f9a19efa7f2",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1928,
    "chunk_text": "The total value of the drugs we have seized is Rs. 218 billion. When cannabis is included, the value rises to Rs. 224 billion. This is the drug market for a single year. When we also take into account the quantities that have not been seized, the enormous scale of the destruction becomes clear.\n\nToday, this menace is engulfing the entire society. There is no longer any institution that remains untouched. It is spreading into religious institutions that are revered and respected. For more than 2,000 years, the Maha Sangha and the Sangha community have travelled from village to village, often wearing out their feet, to help build our society. This menace has reached them, to varying degrees, as well. It has also spread to other religious institutions. The Police, the three armed forces and State institutions have all been affected.\n\nIn place of the State machinery that is visible to us, a \u2018shadow State\u2019 operating from within has emerged. If this continues to grow, all the mechanisms that uphold a respected society, sustain public hope and bring order to society will become ineffective. The enormous illicit wealth they accumulate gives them the ability to take control of all these institutions. I say once again that we have two paths before us.\n\nThey can remain within their shadow State, while we continue carrying out the work entrusted to us within the State. That is how many people have conducted themselves. However, as a Government, we have taken a decision: we will defeat this shadow State and dismantle it. Our children cannot have a secure future unless we dismantle the shadow State linked to drugs. How much hope do parents place in raising their children? Parents spend most of their lives on their children \u2013 to give them a good life, a good future and a safe society. How hard they work. I do not think there is a mother or father anywhere in the world who works harder for their children."
  },
