    "chunk_text": "The relaunch positions The Rainforest Ecolodge as the hospitality gateway to this living ecosystem: a place for travellers who want to do more than simply stay near nature. It is designed for those who want to enter the forest with curiosity, understand what they encounter, immerse themselves in the rainforest, and leave with a stronger connection to the natural world and self.\u201d\n\n\u201cWe want the ecolodge to be more than just a place to stay; we want it to become a meaningful gateway to understanding one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most vital and vibrant ecosystems,\u201d said Susith Jayawickrama, Managing Director \u2013 Aitken Spence Hotel Holdings PLC.\n\nThe ecolodge\u2019s approach has received recognition across sustainability and hospitality platforms. In 2026, The Rainforest Ecolodge was named Silver Winner in the \u2018Nature Positive\u2019 category at the ICRT Indian Subcontinent Awards, recognising its work in biodiversity conservation, responsible nature-based experiences, community benefit, and conservation education. It was also named Sri Lanka\u2019s Leading Lodge 2026 at the World Travel Awards, reinforcing its position as one of the country\u2019s most distinctive nature-led stays."
