    "chunk_text": "HNB invests Rs.3.2 million in vocational training\n\nHNB and SOS Children\u2019s Villages Sri Lanka reaffirmed their enduring commitment towards elevating vocational training and career development at SOS Vocational Training Centres in Jaffna and Malpotha with a contribution of Rs.3.2 million from HNB\n\nEmpowers 80 young people through strengthened partnership with SOS Children\u2019s Villages Sri Lanka\n\nHatton National Bank (HNB) has strengthened its long-standing partnership with SOS Children\u2019s Villages Sri Lanka, committing Rs.3.2 million towards the vocational training and career development of 80 young people at the SOS Vocational Training Centres in Jaffna and Malpotha."
