    "chunk_text": "Under the partnership, the Agriculture Department will provide technical training on land preparation, planting, crop management, fertiliser application and pest and disease control. The Agriculture Insurance Board will provide agricultural insurance to help farmers manage production risks and support access to financing.\n\nThe IRDCRP, supported by the World Bank Group, focuses on enhancing market access, through productive partnership and developing value chains in agriculture, livestock, fisheries and aquaculture.\u00a0 This has been associated with the Agri-connect initiatives, which enhance the livelihoods of over 400,000 farmers for Sri Lanka.\n\nBankable value chain investments will be identified and financed through cost-sharing arrangement, whereby a portion of investment cost will be covered by the IRDCRP."
