    "chunk_size_bytes": 813,
    "chunk_text": "Deepavali an opportunity to overcome hatred, strengthen unity \u2013 PM\n\nPrime Minister Dr. Harini Amarasuriya has said that Deepavali provides an opportunity to overcome hatred, jealousy and ignorance while embracing wisdom, compassion and unity.\n\nIn her Deepavali message, she said the festival symbolises the triumph of light over darkness and good over evil, while highlighting the importance of strengthening mutual understanding, harmony and solidarity among Sri Lanka\u2019s diverse communities.\n\nShe stressed the need to move forward as one nation, transcending ethnic and religious differences, while strengthening cultural bonds.\n\nThe Prime Minister also extended her wishes for happiness, peace, good health and prosperity to all Hindu devotees in Sri Lanka and across the world on the occasion of Deepavali."
