    "chunk_text": "Dialog Pay wins Gold for Best Digital Payments Innovation at Sri Lanka FinTech Awards 2026\n\nFrom left: Dialog Axiata Senior Data Analyst Tuan P. Shiraz, Data Analyst Madavika Munasinghe, Senior Brand Manager Tharindu Karunarathne, Brand Manager Kiythmaa Cooray, Head of Brands, Strategy, Services and Masterbrand Aaqib Reyal, Head of Marketing and Business Performance Shantha Fernando, Group Chief Marketing Officer Lasantha Theverapperuma, Senior Product Manager Tharaka Madusanka, Vice President \u2013 Digital Platforms and Partnerships Muditha Premarathne, Vice President \u2013 Digital Technology Uresh Duminduwardena, Delivery Excellence Manager Nadee Tennakoon, Head of Super App Operations Nadeesh Nanayakkara, and Head of Digital Marketing Jathu Sivapathasundram\n\nDialog Axiata PLC, Sri Lanka\u2019s #1 connectivity provider, won the Gold Award for Best Digital Payments Innovation at the Sri Lanka FinTech Awards 2026, recognising Dialog Pay\u2019s contribution to strengthening Sri Lanka\u2019s national digital payments ecosystem by making secure, convenient, and accessible digital transactions available to consumers and businesses across the country.\n\nLaunched earlier this year, Dialog Pay brings together a comprehensive range of everyday financial transactions through the MyDialog platform and the dedicated Dialog Pay App. Customers can make QR payments, pay bills, transfer money, link bank accounts, access GovPay services and selected financial services through a single digital platform. In a short span of time, Dialog Pay has expanded its QR payment acceptance footprint to more than 100,000 outlets across Sri Lanka, enabling seamless digital transactions for customers while helping merchants participate more actively in the country\u2019s growing digital payments landscape."
