    "chunk_text": "With more than 20 years of leadership experience across banking, financial services, capital markets, the public sector, and academia. Chiranthi brings a strong combination of board governance, enterprise risk, ESG, human capital, organisational transformation, and institutional resilience expertise. Her work focuses on helping boards and senior leadership teams strengthen accountability, culture, leadership capability, internal controls, and sustainable performance.\n\nVenkadeshwara Agro Industry Founder and Managing Director Kanakasingam Suganthon said: \u201cWe started this journey in Jaffna in 2001 with a simple belief: that the North could produce oils as good as any on a Sri Lankan table. Today our refinery supplies households, bakeries and food manufacturers. This Board gives us the experience to take the next step, with more capacity, stronger brands and new markets overseas, without losing the quality and the community that got us here.\u201d\n\nWith its Board in place, the Company\u2019s priorities include expanding production and marketing capacity, building its consumer and bakery-ingredient brands, deepening its presence in export markets, and developing its laboratory into a center offering third-party quality testing to businesses across Sri Lanka.\n\n\u201cVenkadeshwara is driven towards a stronger governance, financial discipline culture with market insight that allows the business to standout. With five independent directors and experience that spans banking, finance, FMCG and exports, we intend to hold ourselves to the standards that investors, lenders and customers expect of the country\u2019s best-run companies,\u201d said Non-Executive Chairman Dr. Bradley Emerson."
