    "chunk_size_bytes": 1418,
    "chunk_text": "Global Brands Awards and \u2018Global Business Forum\u2019 at Temple Trees\n\nKey event brings together international delegates, distinguished personalities and entrepreneurs\n\nColombo became a meeting point for international business engagement as the Global Business Forum 2026 \u2013 Season 3, Sri Lanka Chapter, was held on 31 October at Temple Trees, Colombo.\n\nThe international gathering brought together business leaders, entrepreneurs, distinguished personalities and delegates, creating a platform for professional engagement, international networking and recognition of business achievements.\n\nOrganised by ANYELP GROUP, founded by Zakir Hussain, the program focused on strengthening connections between international business communities while highlighting the importance of innovation, leadership, technology and sustainable business development.\n\nIndian actor Mohammed Ali and Nobel Peace Prize laureate Professor Mohan Munasinghe were among the prominent personalities associated with the gathering.\n\nA central feature of the event was the Global Brands Awards 2026 \u2013 Sri Lanka Chapter, which recognised selected entrepreneurs, business organisations and professionals for their achievements and contributions to their respective industries.\n\nThe awards initiative aims to highlight individuals and organisations demonstrating leadership, innovation, professional excellence and commitment to business development."
