    "chunk_text": "Inmate dies after being gored by deer at Weerawila Open Prison Camp\n\nColombo, Nov. 9 (Daily Mirror) - An inmate undergoing rehabilitation at the Weerawila Open Prison Camp died after being gored by a deer while carrying out cleaning activities within the camp premises, police said.\n\nThe incident occurred yesterday evening (November 8), when the inmate was reportedly attacked by a deer roaming freely within the prison camp.\n\nHe was rushed to Debarawewa Hospital for treatment but later succumbed to his injuries.\n\nThe deceased has been identified as a 30-year-old resident of Warapalana.\n\nHis body is currently lying at the Debarawewa Hospital mortuary, with the post-mortem examination scheduled for today (9).\n\nThe Weerawila Police have launched an investigation into the incident."
