    "chunk_text": "Former President Gotabaya Rajapaksa arrives at CCIB\n\nColombo, Nov. 9 (Daily Mirror) - Former President Gotabaya Rajapaksa arrived at the Central Crime Investigation Bureau (CCIB) today (November 9) to provide a statement in connection with an ongoing investigation involving his former private secretary, Sugeeshwara Bandara.\n\nBandara, who is also the leader of the New People\u2019s Front, is currently in remand custody."
