    "chunk_size_bytes": 645,
    "chunk_text": "Fire in China\u2019s Shanxi province apartment building kills 14\n\nMACAU BUSINESS.COM - A fire that broke out in an apartment building in northern China killed at least 14 people, state media said Monday, raising the death toll from the previous night.\n\nThe blaze occurred in a building in Shanxi province\u2019s Taiyuan city around 5:00 pm on Sunday, the official Xinhua news agency said that evening.\n\n\u201cA total of 38 people were sent to hospitals for treatment, among whom five have died,\u201d Xinhua reported, raising the death toll to 14 on Monday morning.\n\nThe flames were extinguished on Sunday, with search and rescue efforts completed, it said."
