    "chunk_text": "Dialog Axiata PLC, Sri Lanka\u2019s #1 connectivity provider, won the Gold Award for Best Digital Payments Innovation at the Sri Lanka FinTech Awards 2026, recognising Dialog Pay\u2019s contribution to strengthening Sri Lanka\u2019s national digital payments ecosystem by making secure, convenient and accessible digital transactions available to consumers and businesses across the country.\n\nCommenting on the recognition, Supun Weerasinghe, Group Chief Executive of Dialog Axiata PLC, said, \u201cAs Sri Lanka\u2019s digital economy continues to evolve, trusted and accessible digital payment solutions will play an increasingly important role in connecting people, businesses and services. This recognition reflects Dialog\u2019s commitment to building digital platforms that simplify everyday life while supporting broader economic participation and growth.\u201d\n\nThe award reinforces Dialog\u2019s continued commitment to advancing digital innovation through solutions that make everyday transactions simpler and more convenient for Sri Lankan consumers and businesses. Users can explore Dialog Pay and its features through the MyDialog platform, the Dialog Pay App and dialog.lk/dialog-pay."
