    "chunk_size_bytes": 1686,
    "chunk_text": "Sampath Bank and Mastercard collaborate to introduce two exclusive credit card variants for Chartered Professional Members\n\nFrom left: Chirath Samarasekara, Head of Card Centre, Sampath Bank; Buddhika Amunugama, Director of Account Management, Mastercard; Mahesha Amarasuriya, Country Manager, Sri Lanka, Mastercard; Darshin Pathinayake, Chief Business Intelligence Officer, Sampath Bank; Prof. Lakshman R Watawala, Founder and President of CPM Sri Lanka; Dr. J A Ranga Jayakody, Governing Council Member, CPM Sri Lanka and Dilshan Arsakularathna, Chief Executive Officer of CPM Sri Lanka\n\nSampath Bank, in collaboration with Mastercard, is providing members of the Institute of Chartered Professional Managers of Sri Lanka (CPM Sri Lanka) with a tailored premium banking proposition through the Sampath CPM Sri Lanka Platinum and World Mastercard credit cards. Along with offering financial flexibility, the new cards come with a range of exciting travel and lifestyle benefits.\n\nBoth cards offer worldwide Mastercard acceptance, SampathCards Ultra Rewards Points, overseas travel insurance cover of up to US$ 100,000, contactless Tap & Go payments and flexible instalment plans.\n\nDarshin Pathinayake, Chief Business Intelligence Officer, Sampath Bank, said, \u201cOur approach is to create financial propositions recognising the evolving needs and aspirations of different customer segments. The Sampath CPM Sri Lanka Mastercard World and Platinum Credit Cards combine the strength of our card offering with the value of professional affiliation, giving eligible CPM Sri Lanka members access to benefits that complement their lifestyles while supporting greater financial flexibility.\u201d"
