    "md5": "24d0c8fcf92a4c422a0bee122b9ccbe9",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1885,
    "chunk_text": "DoubleTree by Hilton Weerawila Rajawarna Resort earns triple honours\n\nDoubleTree by Hilton Weerawila Rajawarna Resort is celebrating a significant international achievement, securing three prestigious titles at the 2026 World Luxury Awards.\n\nWith one national and two regional honours, the resort has earned recognition across three of its defining offerings: exceptional accommodation, family holidays and destination weddings.\n\nThe resort received the titles of Best Presidential Suite in Sri Lanka, Best Luxury Family Resort in South West Asia and Best Luxury Wedding Resort in South West Asia. Together, these accolades mark a proud milestone for the property, recognising its appeal to the guests travelling for private retreats, meaningful family time and life\u2019s most important celebrations.\n\nThe two South West Asia titles give the achievement particular significance, extending the resort\u2019s recognition beyond Sri Lanka to a regional stage. Success across three distinct categories demonstrates the breadth of the property\u2019s offering and brings further visibility to Weerawila as a destination for leisure and celebrations in Sri Lanka\u2019s deep south.\n\nThe award for Best Presidential Suite in Sri Lanka places one of the resort\u2019s most distinctive accommodation experiences in the national spotlight. Spanning three stories, the Presidential Suite offers a spacious setting for guests seeking privacy, comfort and time together, making it a standout feature of the resort\u2019s accommodation portfolio.\n\nThe title of Best Luxury Family Resort in South West Asia celebrates another central part of the resort\u2019s identity, bringing generations together through shared experiences. Its natural surroundings and opportunities for recreation and discovery provide a setting where families can spend meaningful time together and create memories beyond their everyday routines."
  },
