    "description": "What America\u2019s Midterms Can Teach Us",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/What-Americas-Midterms-Can-Teach-Us/172-354491",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
