    "description": "Beyond Budget surpluses: Making public expenditure work for Sri Lanka\u2019s external sector",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Beyond-Budget-surpluses-Making-public-expenditure-work-for-Sri-Lanka-s-external-sector/4-799840",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
